{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This free demo includes some introductory content from the full version of &quot;Scam Centre Simulator: Under Kingdom&quot;.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/b891e60098933bca2e91b454710dc12c.poster.avif?t=1760267193\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/b891e60098933bca2e91b454710dc12c.webm?t=1760267193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/bcfc714956b8c7dc6f1e133ad87c4f15.poster.avif?t=1760267193\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/bcfc714956b8c7dc6f1e133ad87c4f15.webm?t=1760267193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scam Centre Simulator: Under Kingdom</strong> is a dark management simulation game where survival comes at a cost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burdened by crushing debt, you\u2019re given a chance to escape into a mysterious town \u2014 but only if you can run its underground scam empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit workers with unique skills, manage shady operations, and expand your influence. From bribing police to running scams and keeping workers under control. Will you repay your debts and escape, or be consumed by the kingdom of scams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/f6e838500ecf9528e75ef2ec1986f777.poster.avif?t=1760267193\" width=1170 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/f6e838500ecf9528e75ef2ec1986f777.webm?t=1760267193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/19006b5bebe1ef988d0c07ed9537ed7f.poster.avif?t=1760267193\" width=1081 height=451 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/extras/19006b5bebe1ef988d0c07ed9537ed7f.webm?t=1760267193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Scam Centre \u2013 Feed, discipline, and control workers while scaling your operation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit Unique Talent \u2013 Find workers with different backgrounds and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in Illegal Activities \u2013 From street hustling and police bribery to scams. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate Electricity \u2013 With power in short supply, keep your centre running by producing electricity through garbage recycling and manpower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only will you experience a variety of reality-inspired events, but you\u2019ll also encounter a range of  unexpected situations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086050?t=1760267193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086050/e23bea27504715c6df6118180a869ecee66755a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760267193","capsule_image":"https://shared.